## 1. What Peter actually is

**Peter is your school science-exhibition AI assistant.**

The basic idea:

> **A small physical AI assistant that can listen to people, understand what they say, generate an answer, speak it back, and explain how it works.**

It is **Spider-Man/Peter-inspired**, but Peter isn't just a chatbot on a laptop. The interesting part is the architecture:

```text
             PERSON
                │
                ▼
        🎤 ESP32 + MIC
                │
                │ Wi-Fi
                ▼
       ┌─────────────────┐
       │  LAPTOP / BRAIN │
       │                 │
       │ Speech → Text   │
       │       ↓         │
       │ AI / Logic      │
       │       ↓         │
       │ Text → Speech   │
       └─────────────────┘
                │
                │ Wi-Fi
                ▼
          🔊 ESP32 SPEAKER
```

The **laptop is the brain**.

The **ESP32 is the body/interface**.

