# 14. ESP32 software

ESP32's job should stay relatively simple.

Something like:

```text
BOOT
 ↓
Connect Wi-Fi
 ↓
Connect to Peter server
 ↓
Wait
 ↓
Capture audio
 ↓
Send audio
 ↓
Receive response audio
 ↓
Play response
 ↓
Repeat
```

The ESP32 shouldn't be doing heavyweight AI work.

